      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. can u go into more detail about the specific documents they should have on hand? especially when it comes to those \"in-between\" scenarios like if they have to switch terminals or if their layover is longer than 12 hours. i just want to make sure we aren't missing any tiny bureaucratic details that could cause trouble with immigration officials.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
