      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like there's so many ways to mess this up. like, everything is so hidden and opaque with these immigration rules. it's like you never know what the officer is actually looking for or what tiny thing might trigger a rejection. it feels like they're just looking for any reason to cause problems. what other little things should we watch out for? is there anything else that usually trips people up in these transit zones?",
